; shiv.me - GitHub Pages apex + www  (BIND zone, for Cloudflare import)
;
; Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import and Export > Import DNS records
;
; BEFORE IMPORT (import only adds; it cannot modify/delete):
;   1. DELETE  shiv.me      A      192.241.209.170   (old server)
;   2. DELETE  www.shiv.me  CNAME  shiv.me           (replaced below)
;
; AFTER IMPORT:
;   - keep records "DNS only" (grey) until GitHub provisions the cert,
;     then tick "Enforce HTTPS".
;   - if later set "Proxied" (orange), Cloudflare SSL/TLS must be
;     Full or Full (strict); Flexible causes a redirect loop.
;
; Leave existing MX / TXT / blog / charlie records untouched.

$ORIGIN shiv.me.
$TTL 300

@       IN  A       185.199.108.153
@       IN  A       185.199.109.153
@       IN  A       185.199.110.153
@       IN  A       185.199.111.153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153
www     IN  CNAME   shiva.github.io.
